# A golem crafter (FollowerMovingAroundMaster): as he appears his golem appears where he
# stands (onCreated); five seconds later, then every five seconds, the golem is asked to
# walk to a point within 50 of him, drawn on the x then the y axis (onTimer). The golem's
# appearance and walks send none of the rendered packets; the draws pin the timer's
# offsets, two a tick, and no draw happens as the master appears. The golem line is the
# template the script spawns from (it walks); its own golem stands apart, bound to nothing.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (FollowerMovingAroundMaster.java).
character Seeker 20
random 100 0 0 100
script script.ai.group.FollowerMovingAroundMaster
npc telson 31592 Folk 100 0 0
npc dorothy 31593 MutedFolk 400 0 0 walks

advance 4999ms
advance 1ms
tick x3
advance 5s
tick x3
